    <string name="onboarding_welcome_title">Welcome to Custom Animator</string>
    <string name="onboarding_welcome_body">Speed up your device by tuning animation scales, screen density, battery behaviour and hidden developer settings — all from one place, without root.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_permission_title">One-Time Setup</string>
    <string name="onboarding_permission_body">These settings belong to the system, so the app needs a special permission before it can change anything. Grant it with Shizuku, or by running a single ADB command from a computer.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_permission_highlight">Without this permission the app can read your settings but cannot change them. You will see a warning at the top of any screen that needs it.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_battery_title">Measure Battery Yourself</string>
    <string name="onboarding_battery_body">Battery tweaks change how aggressively Android sleeps, throttles and freezes apps. There is no single best value — it depends on your device, your ROM and the apps you use.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_battery_highlight">Change one thing at a time, then use your device normally for a day and compare. Aggressive settings can drain your battery faster, delay notifications, or stop background apps and alarms from working.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_experimental_title">Experimental by Nature</string>
    <string name="onboarding_experimental_body">Manufacturers modify Android heavily. Some tweaks silently do nothing on your device, some are reverted by the system, and some need a reboot before they take effect.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_experimental_highlight">If something misbehaves, use the reset option in the relevant section or in Settings to return to stock values. When in doubt, note down what you changed before changing it.</string>
